# source: spec
# spec: docs/protocol/compression-header.md#uncompressed-length
# provenance: PV-0060, PV-0061, PV-0062, PV-0063, PV-0064, PV-0066, PV-0067, PV-0068
# kind: compression-header
# description: LZH header for 70000 uncompressed bytes; the length uses three bytes.
# derivation: 70000 = 0x00011170 as u32 LE = 70 11 01 00 (PV-0061, PV-0062); 0x12 = LZH (PV-0064); magic (PV-0067); level 2 (PV-0068).
# expect.error: none
# expect.uncompressed_length: 70000
# expect.algorithm: lzh
# expect.version: 1
# expect.level: 2
hex:
70 11 01 00                                       # uncompressed length, u32 LE
12                                                # algorithm byte
1F 9D                                             # magic
02                                                # byte 7
